      "side": 1,
      "message": "yes its vendor hooks intent to force an early exit. we can just check for index \u003c 0 too. Let me know if you want to modify this.\n\nI added additional check of index \u003e\u003d drv-\u003estate_count to be sure its valid range since someone else in the system can too register for this hook and may try to modify index.",
